\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Concrete Leaf types for the Tech\+Connect conference. Each type reacts meaningfully differently to the same notices. Satisfying task 4.\+1. 

Every leaf\textquotesingle{}s constructor accepts its own schedule (start\+Time/end\+Time, inherited from \doxylink{classEventComponent}{Event\+Component}) since, per the current tree design, both Event\+Groups and individual leaves are scheduled independently. "{}\+Any Event\+Component can be outdoors"{} (see README.\+md), so every leaf below takes an {\ttfamily indoors} parameter defaulting to true -- except \doxylink{classShuttleStop}{Shuttle\+Stop}, which is always outdoors by nature (a bus stop cannot be indoors), so its {\ttfamily indoors} flag is fixed rather than exposed.

Notice-\/reaction policy (see README.\+md for the full table)\+: OPEN, CLOSE, CAPACITY\+\_\+\+ALERT and EVACUATE affect every leaf type below (and every \doxylink{classEventGroup}{Event\+Group}); PAUSE, RESUME, SCHEDULE\+\_\+\+CHANGE and CANCEL affect only \doxylink{classLectureHall}{Lecture\+Hall}, \doxylink{classWorkshopRoom}{Workshop\+Room}, \doxylink{classRegistrationDesk}{Registration\+Desk} and \doxylink{classExhibitionBooth}{Exhibition\+Booth}; WEATHER\+\_\+\+ALERT affects a leaf only when it is actually outdoors; POWER\+\_\+\+OUTAGE affects only \doxylink{classMedicalStation}{Medical\+Station} and \doxylink{classCateringStation}{Catering\+Station}; ANNOUNCEMENT never affects a leaf (Event\+Groups only). 